.TH "INSPEKT\-DO" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-do \- Find and execute actionable elements matching a natural
language instruction.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]do\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] \f[I]INSTRUCTION\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find and execute actionable elements matching a natural language
instruction.
.PP
This command analyzes the page for clickable elements (links, buttons,
forms) and uses AI to match them with your instruction.
It returns a ranked list of matches with confidence scores.
.PP
Behavior:
.IP \(bu 2
If the top match has confidence >= 75%, executes automatically
.IP \(bu 2
For lower confidence, shows matches for manual selection
.IP \(bu 2
Elements are briefly highlighted before clicking
.PP
Great for:
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqGo to the homepage\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqClick the login button\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqSubmit the form\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqOpen the menu\(rq
.IP \(bu 2
\(lqSearch for products\(rq
.PP
The command handles different element types and works with modern SPAs.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]INSTRUCTION\f[R]
required text argument
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enget\-url\f[R]
Output the inspekt:// URL instead of executing
.TP
\f[B]\(endebug\f[R]
Show the full prompt instead of calling AI
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-execute\f[R]
Show matches but don\(cqt execute any actions
.TP
\f[B]\(enforce\-ai\f[R]
Force AI matching, bypass cache and literal matching
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-cache\f[R]
Bypass cache lookup and don\(cqt cache results (useful for testing)
.TP
\f[B]\-f\f[R], \f[B]\(enfocus\f[R]
Focus the browser window before executing action (macOS only)
.TP
\f[B]\-v\f[R], \f[B]\(enverbose\f[R]
Show detailed diagnostic logging
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt do \(dqGo to the homepage\(dq
inspekt do \(dqClick the login button\(dq
inspekt do \(dqSubmit the form\(dq
inspekt do \(dqSearch for products\(dq
inspekt do \(dqSubmit form\(dq \-\-no\-execute
inspekt do \(dqLogin\(dq \-\-focus
inspekt do \(dqbewijs\(dq \-\-no\-cache \-v
.EE
